    <!-- 26F130 (fold-in 4): the launch screen shows the universal
         城轨通 poster (LaunchSplash imageset: splash-st light /
         splash-st-dark dark, compiled by make_iconset.py + actool),
         the same artwork the native splash presents — so the first
         frame already matches the splash instead of a ~1s blank
         white/black beat. The poster is not per-city, so this does
         not revive the build-45 problem (a static Beijing splash
         flashing for other cities). Background stays the adaptive
         system background (white light / black dark), matching the
         poster's own edges. Status bar untouched (must show). -->
